<% content_for :title, "Mortgage Calculator — whizwheel" %>

<%#
  Mortgage calculator page (spec issue #187, DESIGN.md BLEND) — a full home-mortgage
  estimate: principal & interest plus the recurring ownership costs (property tax, home
  insurance, HOA) rolled into the monthly payment, with the total cost, a payment-component
  donut, a balance-over-time curve, and the full amortization schedule.

  Single-mode (fixed-rate, full breakdown) — the inputs don't depend on a chosen mode, so
  there is NO mode picker (DESIGN.md §4 "Mode picker" applies only when inputs vary by mode).
  The form posts over Turbo and re-renders the #result region in place, and works WITHOUT JS
  (server validates). With JS, the mortgage_controller draws the hover charts and paginates
  the long schedule; the no-JS baseline keeps the data table + chart fallbacks reachable.

  Inputs split into two groups by relationship (DESIGN.md §3 — spacing encodes relationship):
    • The LOAN basis (home price, down payment, rate, term) — required.
    • The recurring OWNERSHIP COSTS (property tax, insurance, HOA) — optional, default 0.
  A thin labelled divider separates the groups so the optional costs read as a distinct set,
  not more required fields.

  Layout per DESIGN.md §3 — an input column + a results panel (≈380px 1fr), collapsing to one
  column on mobile. Spacing scale ("targets not minimums"): stacked fields → space-y-5;
  group → group / fields → submit (Section tier) → mt-7/mt-8; column gutters / card padding →
  gap-8 / p-7–p-8 (Layout tier).
%>

<header class="max-w-2xl">
  <p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-accent">Financial</p>
  <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-[-0.035em] text-ink">Mortgage Calculator</h1>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted">
    A full home-mortgage estimate — principal &amp; interest plus property tax, insurance and HOA —
    with the monthly payment breakdown, total cost, and the month-by-month amortization schedule.
    Every figure is computed server-side.
  </p>
</header>

<div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[380px_1fr]">
  <%# ── Input column ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── %>
  <section class="rounded-[18px] border border-border bg-surface p-7 shadow-[0_10px_34px_rgba(150,110,80,0.12)] sm:p-8">
    <%= form_with url: "/calculators/mortgage", scope: :inputs, method: :post do |f| %>

      <%# ── Loan basis (required) — Stacked tier (space-y-5) down the column. ── %>
      <div class="space-y-5">
        <%# Home price — $ affix leading the field. %>
        <div>
          <%= f.label :home_price, "Home price", class: "field-label", for: "inputs_home_price" %>
          <div class="mt-1.5 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-sm font-bold text-label" aria-hidden="true">$</span>
            <%= f.number_field :home_price, id: "inputs_home_price", step: "any", inputmode: "decimal",
                  min: "0", placeholder: "0", class: "field-input" %>
          </div>
        </div>

        <%# Down payment — $ affix leading the field. %>
        <div>
          <%= f.label :down_payment, "Down payment", class: "field-label", for: "inputs_down_payment" %>
          <div class="mt-1.5 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-sm font-bold text-label" aria-hidden="true">$</span>
            <%= f.number_field :down_payment, id: "inputs_down_payment", step: "any", inputmode: "decimal",
                  min: "0", placeholder: "0", class: "field-input" %>
          </div>
        </div>

        <%# Annual interest rate — % affix trailing the field. %>
        <div>
          <%= f.label :annual_rate, "Annual interest rate", class: "field-label", for: "inputs_annual_rate" %>
          <div class="mt-1.5 flex items-center gap-2">
            <%= f.number_field :annual_rate, id: "inputs_annual_rate", step: "any", inputmode: "decimal",
                  min: "0", placeholder: "0", class: "field-input" %>
            <span class="text-sm font-bold text-label" aria-hidden="true">%</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <%# Loan term — whole years. A "years" unit trails the field. %>
        <div>
          <%= f.label :loan_term_years, "Loan term", class: "field-label", for: "inputs_loan_term_years" %>
          <div class="mt-1.5 flex items-center gap-2">
            <%= f.number_field :loan_term_years, id: "inputs_loan_term_years", step: "1", inputmode: "numeric",
                  min: "1", placeholder: "0", class: "field-input" %>
            <span class="w-12 text-sm font-bold text-label" aria-hidden="true">years</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <%# ── Recurring ownership costs (optional, default 0) — a labelled divider
          (Section tier, mt-7) sets these apart from the required loan basis above.

          Each optional field carries an explicit value="0", not just a placeholder: an HTML
          form always POSTs its keys, and the backend's `default: 0` applies only when a key
          is ABSENT — a blank string would cast to nil and fail numericality. Pre-filling 0
          (the spec's "treated as 0" default) keeps a blank-cost submission valid with no JS,
          and the user simply types over the 0 when they have a figure. %>
      <div class="mt-7 border-t border-rule pt-6">
        <p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-faint">Recurring costs (optional)</p>
        <div class="mt-4 space-y-5">
          <%# Annual property tax — $ affix leading, "/ yr" unit trailing. %>
          <div>
            <%= f.label :annual_property_tax, "Annual property tax", class: "field-label", for: "inputs_annual_property_tax" %>
            <div class="mt-1.5 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-sm font-bold text-label" aria-hidden="true">$</span>
              <%= f.number_field :annual_property_tax, id: "inputs_annual_property_tax", step: "any", inputmode: "decimal",
                    min: "0", value: "0", class: "field-input" %>
              <span class="w-10 text-sm font-bold text-label" aria-hidden="true">/ yr</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <%# Annual home insurance — $ affix leading, "/ yr" unit trailing. %>
          <div>
            <%= f.label :annual_home_insurance, "Annual home insurance", class: "field-label", for: "inputs_annual_home_insurance" %>
            <div class="mt-1.5 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-sm font-bold text-label" aria-hidden="true">$</span>
              <%= f.number_field :annual_home_insurance, id: "inputs_annual_home_insurance", step: "any", inputmode: "decimal",
                    min: "0", value: "0", class: "field-input" %>
              <span class="w-10 text-sm font-bold text-label" aria-hidden="true">/ yr</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <%# Monthly HOA fee — $ affix leading, "/ mo" unit trailing (already monthly). %>
          <div>
            <%= f.label :monthly_hoa, "Monthly HOA fee", class: "field-label", for: "inputs_monthly_hoa" %>
            <div class="mt-1.5 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-sm font-bold text-label" aria-hidden="true">$</span>
              <%= f.number_field :monthly_hoa, id: "inputs_monthly_hoa", step: "any", inputmode: "decimal",
                    min: "0", value: "0", class: "field-input" %>
              <span class="w-10 text-sm font-bold text-label" aria-hidden="true">/ mo</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <%# Submit — Section tier above; primary coral button (DESIGN.md §4). %>
      <%= f.submit "Calculate",
            class: "mt-8 w-full cursor-pointer rounded-[13px] bg-primary px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-surface shadow-sm transition-opacity hover:opacity-90 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent" %>
    <% end %>
  </section>

  <%# ── Results panel (the Turbo target) ─────────────────────────────────── %>
  <section id="result" aria-live="polite">
    <%= render "calculators/result", calc: nil %>
  </section>
</div>
